ine the terror but don't think for  a second that the character is a joke  fade is a wicked smart and charismatic  person who's also one of the absolute  best fighters in the known universe  essentially he's a dark mirror image of  protagonists for the tradies in that  they come from a fairly similar  background but while paul's house is a  noble one fade has been fully  assimilated into the ambitious sadistic  culture of house harkening young fade is  conspicuously absent from vilnav's june  part 1 but might just get to make his  grand entrance in the potential sequel  in many ways he's the final ace in baron  harkin in sleeve a critical part of a  story that's only just begun  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite movies and tv shows are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one
 

